---
// How many things the sidebar tracks. From objectives.yml's tracker.max.
import { guide } from '../data/repo';

const max = guide().config.trackerMax;
---
<ul class="facts">
  <li>You can track up to <b>{max} things</b> at once; a sixth waits until you untrack one.</li>
  <li>A finished item leaves the sidebar by itself, and so does a daily that turned over.</li>
  <li>Your list is kept when you log out. <b>/wayfarer track off</b> hides the sidebar, <b>/wayfarer track on</b> brings it back.</li>
</ul>
<style>
  .facts { display: grid; gap: 6px; }
</style>
